{"type":"text","timestamp":1794347946596,"sessionID":"ses_e388ef7b3ffe6Zgw16QrQo7dsU","part":{"id":"prt_1c778d256001kC37mzBVrqTKMH","messageID":"msg_1c778bc07001Bsx9DZ5gN9T1LQ","sessionID":"ses_e388ef7b3ffe6Zgw16QrQo7dsU","type":"text","text":"So CSRF is fine. Let me now add a 405 handler for API paths and double-check the `/api/health` POST etc. Also add a small enhancement: make the frontend catch-all not shadow API POST 405 with HTML.","time":{"start":1794347946582,"end":1794347946593}}}
